1
00:08:21,818 --> 00:08:27,818
The Gigolo Revelation is a documentary film directed by Ally Wong.

2
00:16:43,636 --> 00:16:49,636
A look at Hong Kong's nightlife, where gigolos service women.

3
00:25:05,454 --> 00:25:11,454
Carlos Armando Ponce Freyre Jr.

4
00:33:27,272 --> 00:33:33,272
(born September 4, 1972) is a Puerto Rican actor,
musician, model, and television personality.

5
00:41:49,090 --> 00:41:55,090
Ponce began his acting career by participating in Spanish
language soap operas for Televisa and Telemundo.

6
00:50:10,909 --> 00:50:16,909
Ponce continued to expand his acting career by
participating in various American television series.

7
00:58:32,727 --> 00:58:38,727
He did not limit himself solely to a career in television.

8
01:06:54,545 --> 01:07:00,545
Ponce, who is also a singer, is also active in the
American movie industry as a character actor.

9
01:15:16,363 --> 01:15:22,363
In film, he played Salvadore in Couples Retreat, Matthew Wright in
Spy and Rodrigo in Deuce Bigalow: European Gigolo.

10
01:23:38,181 --> 01:23:44,181
In television, he played Felix Gonzalez in Cristela, Max Duran in Hollywood
Heights, as well as voicing Santiago Santos in Maya & Miguel.
